			"Message": "chore(Wind): Bump catalog version date to 2026-05-26\n\nUpdate the CommandCatalogVersion and ServiceCatalogVersion timestamps from \"2026-05-25\" to \"2026-05-26\" as part of the daily code generation cycle. The tsconfig.tsbuildinfo was also regenerated to reflect the incremental build metadata.\n\nNo functional changes — this is purely a version-date synchronization with the downstream generation pipeline.",
