			"Message": "feat(Wind): Wire per-subsystem tier routing in TauriMainProcessService\n\nAdd the runtime dispatch layer that resolves per-subsystem IPC tiers,\ncompleting TIER-SYSTEM Step 4b. Introduces _ReadTier() to read tier\noverrides from env vars and __LandTiers globals, and\n_ResolveTierForRoute() to map each channel RoutePrefix to its effective\ntier. The TauriChannel.call() method now bypasses Mountain for channels\nresolved to \"Node\", routing directly to Cocoon via the cocoon:request\nbridge. The NodeDeferred fallback also honours per-subsystem tiers so\nchannels like tasks, auth, and encryption default to Node even when the\nglobal _TierIPC is \"Mountain\".\n\nThis makes the Wind service layer respect per-subsystem routing at\nruntime, mirroring the dispatch in Mountain's WindServiceHandlers.",
			"SHA": "b47dc0230f78429ee4f47b805b9e6b74ece0f1e4"
